{
  "_notes": [
    "GOLDEN SCHEDULE — cross-engine contract for deriveGameweeks with a",
    "GameweekSchedule (weeks freeze once locked, skipped dates, per-date",
    "deadline overrides, kickoff-aware automatic deadline). Both twins replay",
    "this file: lib/fantasy/engine/gameweeks.dart (test/fantasy/",
    "gameweeks_test.dart, group golden_schedule) and functions/src/lib/",
    "fantasy/gameweeks.ts (golden_schedule.test.ts). Every expected instant",
    "was computed BY HAND before either engine ran — if a twin disagrees it is",
    "the twin that is wrong; never copy actual values into this file.",
    "",
    "Config is not serialized: the futsal default with lockHour from the case.",
    "Dates are Sundays in Oct/Nov 2026. Oct 4-25 is PDT (UTC-7), Nov 1 onward",
    "is PST (UTC-8; DST ends Sun Nov 1, 2026). lockHour 16 => 4 PM league time",
    "=> 23:00Z in PDT, 00:00Z next day in PST. A week opens at league midnight",
    "after the PREVIOUS week's date (frozen or not): Oct 5 = 07:00Z, Oct 12 =",
    "07:00Z, Oct 26 = 07:00Z, Nov 2 = 08:00Z.",
    "",
    "schedule (all optional): lockedWeeks {\"<n>\": {date, lockUtc, scored?}},",
    "skippedDates [MMDDYYYY], deadlineOverrides {MMDDYYYY: iso},",
    "firstKickoffUtc {MMDDYYYY: iso}, minutesBeforeKickoff (default 60).",
    "dateNode (optional): a season Date node (date -> games). Both twins derive",
    "firstKickoffUtc from it with firstKickoffByDate*(dateNode, startHour) and",
    "merge it into the schedule; an explicit schedule.firstKickoffUtc entry",
    "wins on a clash. startHour (optional, default 0) is the season Start",
    "Time used for the legacy derived kickoff of games with no stored Time.",
    "",
    "Rules replayed: frozen weeks = lockedWeeks 1..L while every key is present",
    "(first gap ends it); later dates = distinct, calendar-sorted, not skipped,",
    "strictly after the last frozen date; lock = override ?? min(lockHour,",
    "firstKickoff - minutes)."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "plain",
      "dates": ["10042026", "10112026", "10182026"],
      "lockHour": 16,
      "expected": [
        {"number": 1, "date": "10042026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-04T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": null, "frozen": false},
        {"number": 2, "date": "10112026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-11T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-05T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false},
        {"number": 3, "date": "10182026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-18T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-12T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "unsorted and duplicate dates",
      "dates": ["10182026", "10042026", "10112026", "10042026"],
      "lockHour": 16,
      "expected": [
        {"number": 1, "date": "10042026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-04T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": null, "frozen": false},
        {"number": 2, "date": "10112026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-11T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-05T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false},
        {"number": 3, "date": "10182026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-18T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-12T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "skipped",
      "dates": ["10042026", "10112026", "10182026"],
      "lockHour": 16,
      "schedule": {"skippedDates": ["10112026"]},
      "expected": [
        {"number": 1, "date": "10042026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-04T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": null, "frozen": false},
        {"number": 2, "date": "10182026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-18T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-05T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "override",
      "dates": ["10042026", "10112026", "10182026"],
      "lockHour": 16,
      "schedule": {"deadlineOverrides": {"10112026": "2026-10-11T20:30:00Z"}},
      "expected": [
        {"number": 1, "date": "10042026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-04T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": null, "frozen": false},
        {"number": 2, "date": "10112026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-11T20:30:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-05T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false},
        {"number": 3, "date": "10182026", "lockUtc": "2026-10-18T23:00:00Z", "opensUtc": "2026-10-12T07:00:00Z", "frozen": false}
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "early kickoff",
      "dates": ["10042026", "10112026", "10182026"],
      "lockHour": 16,
      "schedule": {"firstKickoffUtc": {"10112026": "2026-10-11T22:30:00Z"}, "minutesBeforeKickoff": 60},
